title: "Read a backup archive"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Reading files before manifest
  s1: rejected
  s2: Reading files after manifest
  s3: entries read
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Manifest is missing at end of archive or Reject unsafe path or Duplicate file is rejected
  s0 --> s2: Read manifest
  s2 --> s3: Reach end of archive with manifest
